        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Vernon L. Smith, Brian Bruce, David Dreman, Paul Slovic, Arnold Wood\n- Organizations: Journal of Behavioral Finance, Chapman University, George Mason University, Mercatus Center\n- Roles: Board of Editors, professor of economics, research scholar, Fellow, Nobel Laureate\n- Places: Orange, California, Arlington, Virginia\n\nFacts:\n- Vernon Lomax Smith was born on January 1, 1927.\n- Vernon L. Smith is an American professor of economics at Chapman University's Argyros School of Business and Economics and School of Law in Orange, California.\n- Vernon L. Smith was formerly a research scholar at George Mason University Interdisciplinary Center for Economic Science in Arlington, Virginia.\n- Vernon L. Smith is a Fellow of the Mercatus Center in Arlington, Virginia.\n- The founding Board of Editors of the Journal of Behavioral Finance included Brian Bruce, David Dreman, Paul Slovic, Nobel Laureate Vernon Smith, and Arnold Wood.",
